 "self_load_only": true,
 "description": "BIGVILLE R18 (266000) -- the AFFECT-GATED CLASSROOM (HEADLINE, R6 x the STANDING 239 window) + the schoolmaster's inner life. sc_acquire raises a child's Skill.level by the master's DELIVERED rate ONLY when the child is WITHIN the 239 window (AffectiveState.dysregulated==0), the school is OPEN, and the prerequisite is met -- the window, not the lesson, is the bottleneck. The four sc_fail_* rules PARTITION the non-learning space so the glass box reads WHY (closed / missing-prereq / low-safety-prior / dysregulated -- the marshmallow confound-dissolution). sc_master_quality sets held_rate = stated_rate (fairly-paid, willing) or sabotage_rate (underpaid OR coerced -> 234 stated!=held). NO reward/punishment token. Composes existing DSL Terms; ZERO new Rust; self_load_only.",
